    50	/**
    51	 * The reported item type, resolved against what the policy actually covers. A claim
    52	 * naming an item the policy does not carry is not yet rejected here -- that rule is
    53	 * still driven by an inactive test, so today every reported type is assumed covered.
    54	 */
